continuation purpose "Whether the byte at a position of a range is a continuation byte within bounds (low to high, inclusive)"
continuation invariant none
continuation typeParameter none
continuation input text machine.Address copied
continuation input bytes Int64 copied
continuation input at Int64 copied
continuation input low Int64 copied
continuation input high Int64 copied
continuation output Bool
continuation outputOwnedBy none
continuation raises none
continuation effect use machine.memory
continuation uses memoryAccess
continuation memoryHeap false
continuation async false
continuation maxRecursion none
continuation label begin loopKind none
continuation label begin within none
continuation label outside loopKind none
continuation label outside within none
continuation label readIt loopKind none
continuation label readIt within none
continuation let no Bool false immutable
continuation at begin do insideCheck
continuation at begin branch if inside goto readIt else goto outside
continuation at outside return ok no
continuation at readIt do findByte
continuation at readIt do readByte
continuation at readIt do widen
continuation at readIt do lowCheck
continuation at readIt do highCheck
continuation at readIt do bothCheck
continuation at readIt return ok within

